<title>USA: Matria files suit against women's network.</title>
<headline>Matria files suit against women's network.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Matria Healthcare Inc said Tuesday it had filed a suit against the National Women's Health Network, alleging the organization had made false and misleading statements about the company.</p>
</text>
